  "description": "Circuit-level design and analysis of diode rectifier topologies that convert AC to pulsating DC. Covers half-wave, full-wave center-tap, bridge, and polyphase configurations with ripple calculation, diode PIV/forward-current selection, and transformer sizing. Owns the circuit-design pedagogy; system-level rectifier manufacturing is covered by power-electronics.",
